                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "full disclosure without using a steam guide I would probably not have gotten past the first puzzle. That being said, this is a charming little experience. \n\nDelightfully eerie, reminds me of pottsfield in over the garden wall like I'm clearly in a place living people aren't meant to be. But hey, it's halloween and you gotta have candy.\n\nIt's cheap enough anyway but pick it up in a sale if you're unsure and don't be afraid to use a guide and it's a memorable little game. Make sure to play it in one sitting as well cause you don't wanna lose the vibe.",
